offscreen host submission, not physical gameplay or display parity.

A separate stationary simultaneous-button special recovery probe used
fresh three-tick pulses and 101 object-DMA samples per comparison.
All eight character/button combinations matched their special-only
control at offset 30 and diverged at offset 31. Marge's primary
