Fresh portable validation passed in run 1795618113964657291-2951680.
The optimized 3,224,528-byte native build passed offscreen OpenGL ES
adaptive touch-and-combat smoke with the verified 88-pose catalogue.
All 600 movement and 60 combat submissions met the 16.667 ms
