This does not establish original combat or physical display parity.

Aerial follow-up timing was compared against the original isolated
forward attacks at five, fifteen and thirty jump-input offsets.
For Marge, both buttons were rejected at respective flight offsets
33, 21 and 24, and accepted at 34, 22 and 25. All rejected
