Fractional carry between independent actions and collision behavior
remain provisional.

The stationary special and ordinary short jump allow a horizontal
turn at landing, but not normal walking on that tick. For all
four special controls, Up on landing matched all 101 frames;
Left changed facing while preserving the idle actor's position
apart from mirrored sprite offsets. Marge's forward aerial
attack instead rejected both tested directions on landing.
The short-jump Up probes matched the Marge and Homer controls;
Bart and Lisa instead showed a two-pixel translation of all
